# Alladin board files are edited EXCLUSIVELY through the alladin-pcb MCP
# tools -- the running Alladin instance validates every change (real JLCPCB
# rules, correct-by-construction). Hiding the .json board files from the AI
# agent closes the bypass: it can neither read nor edit them directly, so
# the MCP tools are the only path that exists.
#
# If your project folder also contains non-board .json files the AI should
# see (e.g. package.json), add a negation line for them below, like the
# .cursor/ one.
*.json
!.cursor/
!.cursor/**
